      NEW met1 ( 25990 8670 ) ( 26450 * )
      NEW met1 ( 25990 8670 ) M1M2_PR
      NEW li1 ( 26450 8670 ) L1M1_PR_MR ;
    - a ( PIN a ) ( _13_ B ) ( _12_ B ) ( _11_ B ) ( _10_ B ) ( _09_ SLEEP ) ( _08_ B ) + USE SIGNAL
      + ROUTED met1 ( 26910 9690 ) ( 27370 * )
      NEW met2 ( 27370 6460 ) ( * 9690 )
      NEW met2 ( 27370 6460 ) ( 27830 * )
      NEW met2 ( 27830 340 0 ) ( * 6460 )
      NEW met1 ( 25070 9350 ) ( * 9690 )
