      NEW met1 ( 23690 12070 ) M1M2_PR
      NEW met1 ( 23690 9350 ) M1M2_PR
      NEW li1 ( 22310 12070 ) L1M1_PR_MR ;
    - b ( PIN b ) ( _13_ A ) ( _12_ A ) ( _11_ A ) ( _10_ A ) ( _09_ A ) ( _08_ A ) + USE SIGNAL
      + ROUTED met1 ( 22310 6630 ) ( 24150 * )
      NEW met2 ( 24150 340 0 ) ( * 6630 )
      NEW met1 ( 24150 9690 ) ( 24610 * )
      NEW met2 ( 24150 6630 ) ( * 9690 )
      NEW met1 ( 21390 9690 ) ( 24150 * )
      NEW met1 ( 24150 12070 ) ( 24610 * )
