      NEW li1 ( 21390 9690 ) L1M1_PR_MR
      NEW li1 ( 24610 12070 ) L1M1_PR_MR
      NEW met1 ( 24150 12070 ) M1M2_PR
      NEW li1 ( 21390 12410 ) L1M1_PR_MR
